ithub.com/repos/rhasspy/piper/zipball/v1.0.0","body":"- Use [fork of espeak-ng](https://github.com/rhasspy/espeak-ng) for punctuation preservation and sentence boundary detection\r\n- Support raw text phonemes with [piper-phonemize](https://github.com/rhasspy/piper-phonemize)\r\n- Support Arabic diacritization with [libtashkeel](https://github.com/mush42/libtashkeel/) (model included)\r\n- Extend default phoneme set to 256 for future expansion (use [these pretrained checkpoints](https://huggingface.co/datasets/rhasspy/piper-checkpoints/tree/main)) \r\n- New command-line options (`--silence_seconds`,  `--espeak_data`, `--tashkeel_model`, `--debug`) \r\n- Merge code into `piper.hpp` and `piper.cpp` for use as a library\r\n- Update to onnxruntime 1.14.1 (from [piper-phonemize](https://github.com/rhasspy/piper-phonemize))\r\n- Adding logging with spdlog","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhasspy/piper/releases/108252474/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}